  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MPCA to returnees and host communities in NWS - Violet (Cordaid)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this action the direct impact of the provision of MPCA will be to help increase the purchasing power of 825 households targeted across AlAtareb, Afrin,&#xa0; (Aleppo) and Salqin and Idelb (Idleb) Districts (4,125 individuals, 5.13% of whom will be PwDs),
Using a phased financial assistance approach, 4 rounds of MPCA will be carried out to provide a cumulative aid of $400 per household with CORDAID funds.&#xa0; This will then be increased with 2 additional rounds from CA Appeal TSEQ&#xa0;to enable in total, 6 rounds of 100$ each to be provided to each family, over an extended 6 month period. Following CWG guidelines, the disbursement of cash will be structured at overall, 6 rounds, with 4 funded initially via this Giro action, and the remaining 2 rounds funded with additional CA own resources</narrative>
  </description>
